WEBVTT

00:23:57.792 --> 00:24:02.395
While it's not the same feedback loop
as in the American government system,

00:24:02.419 --> 00:24:04.783
I think any government's right to govern

00:24:04.807 --> 00:24:07.760
is measured by people's acceptance

00:24:07.784 --> 00:24:11.006
and happiness with the rules
and regulations.

00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:12.569
So as an example,

00:24:12.593 --> 00:24:17.982
the Chinese government came out
with a possible increase in taxes

00:24:18.006 --> 00:24:20.362
for VCs like us.

00:24:20.386 --> 00:24:22.616
So VCs spoke up and said,

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:27.009
"Wait a minute, let's look
at the implications of this tax.

00:24:27.033 --> 00:24:29.515
On the one hand,
you may get some more money,

00:24:29.539 --> 00:24:30.785
on the other hand,